# Response headers for the static origin.
#
# The measured, literal headers actually returned by the host are recorded in
# docs/runbooks/pages-headers.md on main (TR-CI-160, OIQ-04). This file states
# intent; that runbook states fact, and where they disagree the runbook is
# right. Not every static host honours this file.

/*
  Access-Control-Allow-Origin: *
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: no-referrer

/*.json
  Content-Type: application/json; charset=utf-8
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=300, stale-while-revalidate=86400
